  "description": "This package allows you to analyze documents page by page using Azure OpenAI. For each page, it extracts textual content and generates semantic descriptions of any images, effectively combining OCR capabilities with multimodal AI. Ideal for intelligent document processing pipelines, it transforms scanned or image-based documents into structured, enriched data using the power of Azure OpenAI models.",
